{
  "$description": "Design tokens of Housecairn mobile. Every group but `component` is a copy of design/tokens.json of the web application (HouseCairn/housecairn), value for value; `component` holds the few sizes the web components write in their own CSS, read from the file named in `$sources`. lib/design/tokens.dart carries them in Dart, and test/design_tokens_test.dart fails when the two differ. `$sources` gives the web path of every value; docs/adr/0011-design-from-the-web-app.md says what the app takes and what it adapts.",
  "$web-description": "HouseCairn design tokens. Single source for the web CSS variables and, later, the iOS app. Values come from the v2 mock-up (colours, radii, type scale), adjusted where WCAG 2.2 AA requires it (see docs/adr/0017). Regenerate the CSS with `uv run python manage.py build_design_tokens`.",
